        "Today we complete our first week by building a comprehensive battlefield map. You have studied the five core subjects of atheism and yesterday you saw how they interconnect. Today you will learn to identify which subject an atheist is operating from in real-time and deploy the appropriate SDA response.\n\nThink of each subject as a \u2018front\u2019 in a war. Naturalism is the northern front\u2014the metaphysical claim about what exists. Materialism is the eastern front\u2014the claim about what things are made of. Scientism is the southern front\u2014the epistemological claim about how we know. Moral relativism is the western front\u2014the ethical claim about right and wrong. And the problem of evil is the aerial bombardment\u2014the emotional strike that comes from above all the others.\n\nColossians 2:8 warns, \u201CBeware lest any man spoil you through philosophy and vain deceit, after the tradition of men, after the rudiments of the world, and not after Christ.\u201D Paul is not anti-philosophy; he is warning against philosophy that starts from human autonomy rather than Christ. Every atheist argument ultimately rests on the assumption that human reason, unaided by revelation, is the final authority. This is the \u2018rudiments of the world\u2019\u2014the elementary principles of a God-denying system.\n\nAs SDA apologists, our foundation is Christ as revealed in Scripture, confirmed by prophecy, and illuminated by the Spirit of Prophecy. We stand on a Rock while the atheist stands on shifting sand. Isaiah 8:20 gives our standard: \u201CTo the law and to the testimony: if they speak not according to this word, it is because there is no light in them.\u201D This is not arrogance\u2014it is confidence in a revealed, tested, and prophetically confirmed worldview.",
