      tacticalBriefing:
        "Today\u2019s focus is rapid identification and response. When an atheist speaks, mentally classify their argument: Is this a naturalism claim? Materialism? Scientism? Moral relativism? Problem of evil? Once classified, deploy the corresponding counter-argument you\u2019ve learned this week. Speed of classification is key\u2014in live conversation, you may have only seconds to identify the front and respond. Practice will make this second nature.",
